# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# 前端已拆仓（qaqh-desktop-app，2026-10-07）：本仓不再有 webui/，
# node_modules / out / src/api 生成物都在那边。

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
# ts-rs 忘了带 TS_RS_EXPORT_DIR 时会散落到各 crate（真相在 qaqh-desktop-app 的
# src/api/，由那边的 `just ts-export` 生成并入库；见 justfile「桌面客户端」段）
crates/*/bindings/

# HarmonyOS hvigor 构建缓存（build-logs 等，非源码）
.hvigor/

# WorkBuddy 会话目录不入库，但项目记忆例外——
# 记忆随仓库走：重置/换机后 clone 即自动恢复（handover 见 docs/handover-2026-09-09.md）
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/memory/

# QAQ-Harness 自身运行时的会话状态（todo/journal/trash 等），不入库
.qaqh/

# 本地 git worktree 与代理工作区（约定见 docs/todo/README.md §5.2）
/.codex/worktree/
